{
 "format": 2,
 "id": "scanner-panel-local-player",
 "rev": 3,
 "name": "Scanner panel only for its own player",
 "description": "Show, hide and tear down the circuit scanner panel (Widget_DebugScreen) only on the machine of the player holding the scanner. C3 decides who gets a panel (\"is this mine\" = the scanner's Player Controller variable is valid and IsLocalController); equip, unequip, Tick and EndPlay then act only where the panel exists (IsValid(Debup)). EndPlay cleanup runs only for EndPlayReason Destroyed. Rev 1 used Get Instigator Character (null at BeginPlay). Rev 2 repeated the controller test at equip/unequip. Written against TrueGrid 1.3.4 (upstream 59f320b), asset FGNetworkScanner, EventGraph.",
 "asset": "/TrueGrid/Equipment/CircuitScanner/FGNetworkScanner",
